event('C.6.semistable-blowup-diagnostic','first proof','Wrote the full strict-semistable blowup construction for any smooth projective residue variety embedded in projective space. Local p=t_i v charts and the nonsplit normal exact sequence give the two components and projective-bundle intersection. Restriction from the exceptional component is surjective, so dual Gysin is injective and all outer E2 terms cancel. Transverse cuts still kill the supplied pulled-back cycle in the restriction cokernel, but no claim is made about arbitrary new primitive cut classes. Full proof in post07/bgv_semistable_blowup_diagnostic.md.')
