event('B.1.Frobenius-completion-counterexample','independent re-proof','Read the complete part_b/frobenius_completion_counterexample.md. Locally constant integer functions on Z3 have locally finite translation, whereas the3-adic completion contains the continuous eigenfunction4^x. Compatibility follows from the stated valuation formula and the nonzero eigenfunction survives rationalization. This written audit did not rerun the script or reread its output.')
