event('B.5.finite-field-coefficient-duality','independent re-proof','Read the complete part_b/b5_finite_field_coefficient_duality.md. Verified Chow-heart duals, higher-Chow shifts, the e-on-left Koszul sign, degree-one point trace, both Beilinson-plus-Parshin equivalence directions and projective-line degree-three cross-pairing. Q=P(-1)[-2] gives exactly the required second block. The all-Chow-heart versus homogeneous-pure coefficient limitation is essential and retained. Kahn primary source was not independently reopened in this audit; detailed post07/b5_coefficient_duality_written_audit.md.')
